  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Insourced Roles for the Democratic Governance Centre of Expertise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project (component) funds FCDO technical expertise for the delivery of the Democratic Governance Centre of Expertise.  These roles are typically Senior Governance Advisers recruited to support the expansion and deepening of the Centre&apos;s work helping FCDO Posts with democratic governance and open societies themed analysis and advice.</narrative>
  </description>
